      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR WALLY (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (19.73) at this track behind Nobby in a Grade 5. Worked home well on that occasion and should be strong late. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from four starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. BENTLEY OLAF (3) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and three minors from seven tries. Hit the frame latest (30.29) when third at Q Parklands in a OPEN. Can hit the frame with the right run. AERATION (6) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at Q Lakeside over 390m behind Backburn Bluey (22.34) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Form from his last run is proving strong. Shapes as one to consider. FLYAWAY JACK (2) collected a minor prize last start and must be considered.",
